Two of you.

7
01:12:55.834 --> 01:12:57.834
Hallelujah.

8
01:12:57.834 --> 01:13:04.834
I actually didn't want to let this Sunday pass as the last Sunday of the year without...

9
01:13:04.834 --> 01:13:14.834
...just look, but I still want to teach something, to give a piece of teaching.

10
01:13:15.834 --> 01:13:26.834
