144
01:23:26.834 --> 01:23:29.834
and here you see how Paul is writing...

145
01:23:29.834 --> 01:23:32.834
this is a compilation of several letters...

146
01:23:32.834 --> 01:23:34.834
this is a copy of that...

147
01:23:34.834 --> 01:23:36.834
and what stands out to you here?

148
01:23:36.834 --> 01:23:38.834
What stands out here is...

149
01:23:38.834 --> 01:23:41.834
you don't see any periods, or...

150
01:23:41.834 --> 01:23:43.834
