184
01:25:32.834 --> 01:25:34.834
Impossible.

185
01:25:34.834 --> 01:25:37.834
And so at the end of 2025 I want to say...

186
01:25:37.834 --> 01:25:39.834
thank you Lord, that we have the Bible.

187
01:25:39.834 --> 01:25:44.834
