721
01:52:03.834 --> 01:52:05.834
You must do this.

722
01:52:05.834 --> 01:52:08.834
This is a teaching from Paul, an instruction from Paul.

723
01:52:08.834 --> 01:52:10.834
And then in verse 6...

724
01:52:10.834 --> 01:52:12.834
Where are you all not present?

725
01:52:12.834 --> 01:52:13.834
What then?

726
01:52:13.834 --> 01:52:16.834
Philippians chapter 2?

727
01:52:16.834 --> 01:52:18.834
Did I say 1?

728
01:52:18.834 --> 01:52:20.834
Yes, that is a test.

729
01:52:20.834 --> 01:52:22.834
At the end of the year.

730
01:52:22.834 --> 01:52:25.834
Philippians chapter 2, everyone knows that, right?

731
01:52:25.834 --> 01:52:27.834
Okay, here it goes.

732
01:52:27.834 --> 01:52:32.834
You read here in verse 5 an instruction from the apostle to the church.

733
01:52:32.834 --> 01:52:36.834
You must have the mindset that was also in Christ.

734
01:52:36.834 --> 01:52:38.834
That is directed towards you.

735
01:52:38.834 --> 01:52:42.834
And then now in verse 6 he jumps into a doxology.

736
01:52:42.834 --> 01:52:44.834
And that doxology is...

737
01:52:57.834 --> 01:52:59.834
...and to become like men.

738
01:53:27.834 --> 01:53:29.834
And then he goes again...

739
01:53:29.834 --> 01:53:32.834
...to the glory of God the Father.

740
01:53:32.834 --> 01:53:34.834
That is worship.

741
01:53:34.834 --> 01:53:40.834
Worship is whether your life is to the glory of God the Father.

742
01:53:41.834 --> 01:53:44.834
My last reflection question to all of us.

743
01:53:44.834 --> 01:53:46.834
And then I will close this service.

744
01:53:46.834 --> 01:53:48.834
Maybe we can stand up.

745
01:53:48.834 --> 01:53:51.834
Then I can close this service with a doxology.

746
01:53:51.834 --> 01:53:54.834
Have we learned something today?

747
01:53:55.834 --> 01:53:57.834
Happy.

748
01:54:00.834 --> 01:54:02.834
Hallelujah.

749
01:54:05.834 --> 01:54:07.834
Can we come to prayer please?

750
01:54:07.834 --> 01:54:10.834
I just want to pray for us.

751
01:54:11.834 --> 01:54:14.834
Please close your eyes at the end of this service.

752
01:54:14.834 --> 01:54:16.834
I want to pray for all of us.

753
01:54:17.834 --> 01:54:19.834
We have laid ourselves down.

754
01:54:19.834 --> 01:54:25.834
Let's take a moment in these last two minutes to be in prayer.

755
01:54:25.834 --> 01:54:27.834
Please, close your eyes.

756
01:54:30.834 --> 01:54:33.834
Lord, I want to pray for Open Church.

757
01:54:34.834 --> 01:54:37.834
Lord, I thank you that you are so good to us.

758
01:54:38.834 --> 01:54:42.834
I really want to pray for Open Church that we will be a church...

759
01:54:42.834 --> 01:54:47.834
I really want to pray for Open Church that we will be a church that looks to Jesus.

760
01:54:48.834 --> 01:54:53.834
Lord, that we take our focus off ourselves in 2026.

761
01:54:53.834 --> 01:54:56.834
But that we will look to the Son for who He is.

762
01:54:56.834 --> 01:54:59.834
And for what He has done for us.

763
01:55:00.834 --> 01:55:04.834
But also His mighty plan, Lord, that we may be in Christ.

764
01:55:04.834 --> 01:55:07.834
To the glory of God the Father.

765
01:55:08.834 --> 01:55:12.834
And in reflection, I want to ask us as a church, while we are in prayer...

766
01:55:12.834 --> 01:55:14.834
Think about this question.

767
01:55:15.834 --> 01:55:22.834
Have you truly been busy pleasing Him in 2025?

768
01:55:22.834 --> 01:55:24.834
To be closer to Him?

769
01:55:25.834 --> 01:55:29.834
And while all those eyes are closed and I am speaking to your soul...

770
01:55:29.834 --> 01:55:33.834
Is that just a fair question and you don't have to be hard on it.

771
01:55:33.834 --> 01:55:37.834
If there are people among us who have been very focused on themselves...

772
01:55:37.834 --> 01:55:40.834
Or you have even been in sin and you are stuck in it...

773
01:55:40.834 --> 01:55:48.834
Then let 2026 be the year to set your life in glorification towards the Father.

774
01:55:48.834 --> 01:55:52.834
That you will glorify the Father, that you will magnify God with your life.

775
01:55:53.834 --> 01:55:58.834
Lord, I want to pray for Open Church for those people who want to stand in that.

776
01:55:58.834 --> 01:56:05.834
So that we want to take the practical step to be more in Christ.

777
01:56:05.834 --> 01:56:08.834
Lord, I want to bless us with the Holy Spirit.

778
01:56:08.834 --> 01:56:15.834
That it will be the power of the Holy Spirit that will help you to take that step.

779
01:56:16.834 --> 01:56:22.834
Dear church, this is a walk of coming closer to Him step by step.

780
01:56:23.834 --> 01:56:26.834
Come closer to the Lord and He will come closer to you.

781
01:56:26.834 --> 01:56:34.834
And for one person, and I want to bless you with this, for one person that is to start reading the Bible in 2026.

782
01:56:34.834 --> 01:56:40.834
But let 2026 also be the year that you start reading the Bible.

783
01:56:41.834 --> 01:56:44.834
For others it will be that you will learn to pray.

784
01:56:44.834 --> 01:56:52.834
As you saw at the beginning of this service, that other people can really let their tongues move by starting to pray.

785
01:56:52.834 --> 01:56:59.834
My instruction is, when you pray in your own room, do not do it whispering or softly in your head.

786
01:56:59.834 --> 01:57:01.834
But learn to pray out loud.

787
01:57:01.834 --> 01:57:03.834
In your room.

788
01:57:03.834 --> 01:57:05.834
This is what Jesus wants.

789
01:57:05.834 --> 01:57:13.834
He wants you to start glorifying Him in your bedroom, or in the conservatory, or in the living room, or in the office.

790
01:57:13.834 --> 01:57:17.834
Why? He wants to hear it for the glorification of the Father.

791
01:57:18.834 --> 01:57:22.834
And so that your tongue is trained to glorify Him.

792
01:57:22.834 --> 01:57:28.834
To not talk about yourself or gossip about your brothers and sisters, but to glorify Him.

793
01:57:28.834 --> 01:57:31.834
For your tongue is not your own, it belongs to the Lord.

794
01:57:31.834 --> 01:57:38.834
And so I bless us all that we will take a step closer to King Jesus in 2026.

795
01:57:38.834 --> 01:57:44.834
If you struggle to trust Him in 2026, make a choice.

796
01:57:44.834 --> 01:57:48.834
To say, I will trust Him again.

797
01:57:48.834 --> 01:57:51.834
I will come closer to Him again.

798
01:57:51.834 --> 01:57:55.834
If you need to come to repentance from sin, then repent.

799
01:57:55.834 --> 01:57:57.834
Maybe He will return tomorrow.

800
01:57:57.834 --> 01:58:02.834
Repent from your sin. Repent from your stubbornness.

801
01:58:02.834 --> 01:58:04.834
Make sure you are in Christ.

802
01:58:04.834 --> 01:58:08.834
To the glory of God the Father in heaven.

803
01:58:08.834 --> 01:58:11.834
In Jesus' mighty name. Amen.

804
01:58:11.834 --> 01:58:12.834
Amen, amen.

805
01:58:12.834 --> 01:58:14.834
Shall we give Him a round of applause?

806
01:58:21.834 --> 01:58:23.834
Alright, dear people.

807
01:58:23.834 --> 01:58:27.834
Next Sunday we will give everyone a blessing.

808
01:58:27.834 --> 01:58:32.834
All families will receive a blessing with anointing oil for the new year.

809
01:58:32.834 --> 01:58:35.834
So I would appreciate it if everyone would just come.

810
01:58:35.834 --> 01:58:41.834
Bring your family and at the end of the service everyone will receive a blessing for the new year.

811
01:58:41.834 --> 01:58:44.834
And in the church app, the agenda for the coming year is available.

812
01:58:44.834 --> 01:58:46.834
And we need to emphasize that every time.

813
01:58:46.834 --> 01:58:49.834
Because the church agenda contains the things we are going to do.

814
01:58:49.834 --> 01:58:52.834
And even if we sometimes do things differently.

815
01:58:52.834 --> 01:58:58.834
As you know, in the past few years we have always taken the fixed time at the beginning of the year.

816
01:58:58.834 --> 01:58:59.834
For ten days long.

817
01:58:59.834 --> 01:59:04.834
This year, in 2026, we will take a few days in January.

818
01:59:05.834 --> 01:59:11.834
And a number of days between the ascension and the coming of the Holy Spirit.

819
01:59:11.834 --> 01:59:13.834
Fixed, right?

820
01:59:13.834 --> 01:59:16.834
Between the ascension and the second coming.

821
01:59:16.834 --> 01:59:18.834
That's when you really fall off.

822
01:59:20.834 --> 01:59:24.834
So please keep an eye on the church calendar.

823
01:59:24.834 --> 01:59:28.834
And my last tip, dear people, before we all go off to do our own things.

824
01:59:28.834 --> 01:59:30.834
Here is one last tip that I really want to share.

825
01:59:30.834 --> 01:59:33.834
Coming up on December 31.

826
01:59:33.834 --> 01:59:39.834
Make sure to celebrate New Year's Eve with people.

827
01:59:39.834 --> 01:59:42.834
What I'm saying is not an obligation.

828
01:59:42.834 --> 01:59:46.834
But think about who you spend time with.

829
01:59:46.834 --> 01:59:51.834
I have made a choice with myself for a few years now with my wife.

830
01:59:51.834 --> 01:59:59.834
I want to be with those people with whom I can simply end up in a doxology.

831
01:59:59.834 --> 02:00:01.834
Do you understand what I mean?

832
02:00:01.834 --> 02:00:07.834
I want to spend time with people, share meals, and have a good time with them.

833
02:00:07.834 --> 02:00:11.834
That when I sit at that table, we can talk wonderfully about Jesus.

834
02:00:11.834 --> 02:00:13.834
You can talk about anything.

835
02:00:13.834 --> 02:00:16.834
You can talk about good food and what is happening in the world.

836
02:00:16.834 --> 02:00:18.834
You can talk about many beautiful things.

837
02:00:18.834 --> 02:00:24.834
But if the Holy Spirit then guides you at the table in that conversation towards a doxology.

838
02:00:24.834 --> 02:00:26.834
Then that should be possible.

839
02:00:26.834 --> 02:00:31.834
If that is not possible, my tip is to ask yourself.

840
02:00:31.834 --> 02:00:35.834
Should I always be with those people in community?

841
02:00:35.834 --> 02:00:38.834
Listen carefully, we are called for the world.

842
02:00:38.834 --> 02:00:42.834
So you may be in the lives of the people who do not yet know Jesus.

843
02:00:42.834 --> 02:00:44.834
I am not saying that you should not engage with them.

844
02:00:44.834 --> 02:00:46.834
You must also be there for those people.

845
02:00:46.834 --> 02:00:50.834
But those people who may recharge you and who may bless you.

846
02:00:50.834 --> 02:00:53.834
And who may help you grow in Christ.

847
02:00:53.834 --> 02:00:57.834
Those are the people who want to look at Him together at the table.

848
02:00:57.834 --> 02:01:00.834
So for example on the past first and second Christmas Eve.

849
02:01:00.834 --> 02:01:03.834
Do you all look together at the birth of Jesus?

850
02:01:03.834 --> 02:01:08.834
Or was it just about the delicious food and was talking about the birth of Jesus after that?

851
02:01:08.834 --> 02:01:13.834
That is a strong indication of whether your brothers and sisters are in Christ?

852
02:01:13.834 --> 02:01:15.834
As Jesus also said.

853
02:01:15.834 --> 02:01:17.834
Who are my mother and my brothers?

854
02:01:17.834 --> 02:01:20.834
It is they who are concerned with the kingdom of God.

855
02:01:20.834 --> 02:01:25.834
So when you are going to celebrate joyfully on December 31.

856
02:01:25.834 --> 02:01:27.834
Here is my tip.

857
02:01:27.834 --> 02:01:28.834
As I always do.

858
02:01:28.834 --> 02:01:30.834
And I want to share it with you.

859
02:01:30.834 --> 02:01:34.834
Make sure to create some silence around 10 to 12.

860
02:01:34.834 --> 02:01:35.834
Have friendship.

861
02:01:35.834 --> 02:01:37.834
That you stand together for a moment.

862
02:01:37.834 --> 02:01:39.834
That you close the year in prayer.

863
02:01:39.834 --> 02:01:41.834
Share a Bible verse.

864
02:01:41.834 --> 02:01:44.834
Do it until 12 o'clock or go past 12 o'clock.

865
02:01:44.834 --> 02:01:45.834
You should decide for yourself.

866
02:01:45.834 --> 02:01:48.834
But close the year with Jesus.

867
02:01:48.834 --> 02:01:49.834
Amen.

868
02:01:50.834 --> 02:01:51.834
Have a nice week.

869
02:02:20.834 --> 02:02:24.834
Subtitles by the Amara.org community
